---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service - AI Resume Advisor">
  <Header />

  <main class="bg-white py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-text-primary">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-text-caption">Last Updated: November 28, 2025</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-text-body">
        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">1. Welcome to AI Resume Advisor LLC</h2>
          <p>
            Welcome to the services provided by AI Resume Advisor LLC ("we," "our," or "Company"), registered at 30 N Gould St Ste N Sheridan, WY 82801. These Terms of Service ("Terms") establish the conditions that apply to you when you use our website, applications, and services (collectively, the "Service").
          </p>
          <p>
            By accessing or using our Service, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree to these Terms, please do not use our Service.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">2. Description of Service</h2>
          <p>AI Resume Advisor LLC provides the following services:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>
              <strong>Job-Resume Alignment Analysis:</strong> Our AI analyzes job descriptions and your resume to calculate an Alignment Score (semantic match) and Keyword Coverage Rate, providing a comprehensive assessment of how well you match a target role.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Gap Identification:</strong> We identify two types of gaps between your resume and job requirements:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2">
                <li>Presentation Gaps: Skills you have but aren't effectively communicated</li>
                <li>Skill Gaps: Skills you need to develop for your target role</li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>AI-Powered Resume Optimization:</strong> For presentation gaps, our AI rewrites your resume to better showcase your existing experience in the language employers want to see.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Skill Development Recommendations:</strong> For skill gaps, we recommend relevant courses and certifications to help you bridge the gap, with clear guidance on what to learn, in what order, and how much it matters.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Job Alignment Simulator:</strong> Add courses, certifications, or projects to your resume and see how your alignment score changes in real time—before investing your time and money.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Career Assessment Reports:</strong> Detailed reports including strengths, weaknesses, quick wins, and personalized development suggestions.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Resume Storage and Management Services.</strong>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Other career development-related services.</strong>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">3. User Registration and Account</h2>
          <ul class="list-[lower-alpha] pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>You must be at least 18 years old to use our Service.</li>
            <li>You need to register an account to use certain features of our Service.</li>
            <li>You are responsible for maintaining the security of your account, including protecting your password.</li>
            <li>You agree to provide accurate, complete, and up-to-date registration information.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">4. User Responsibilities and Code of Conduct</h2>
          <p>When using our Service, you agree to:</p>
          <ul class="list-[lower-alpha] pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Not violate any applicable laws or regulations.</li>
            <li>Not infringe on the intellectual property or other rights of others.</li>
            <li>Not upload materials containing viruses, malicious code, or other harmful content.</li>
            <li>Not engage in behavior that may damage the Service or affect other users' experience.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">5. Intellectual Property and User Content</h2>
          <ul class="list-[lower-alpha] pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Our Service, including all related intellectual property rights, is owned by AI Resume Advisor LLC.</li>
            <li>
              You retain full ownership and control over the content you upload to our Service, including your resume and personal information. By using our Service, you grant us a limited license to store, process, and analyze your content solely for the purpose of providing and improving our Service to you. We will not use your personal information or resume content for any other purpose without your explicit consent. You can delete your content from our Service at any time, and we will promptly remove it from our active systems, though some information may remain in our backup systems for a limited time.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">6. Privacy and Data Processing</h2>
          <p>
            We value your privacy. Please refer to our <a href="/privacy" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-hover">Privacy Policy</a> for information on how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">7. Payment and Subscriptions</h2>
          <ul class="list-[lower-alpha] pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>
              We offer both free and paid services:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2">
                <li><strong>Free Plan:</strong> 10 credits per day (approximately 5 complete job assessments). No credit card required.</li>
                <li><strong>Daily Pass:</strong> $6 USD for 24 hours of unlimited access.</li>
                <li><strong>Weekly Pass:</strong> $20 USD for 7 days of unlimited access (Best Value - save over 50%).</li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li>Payments are processed through Stripe. By using our paid services, you agree to Stripe's terms of service.</li>
            <li>Subscriptions do not automatically renew. Each pass expires after its designated period.</li>
            <li>Refund Policy: In principle, we do not provide refunds after purchase. However, we reserve the right to consider refund requests on a case-by-case basis.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">8. Termination</h2>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to terminate or suspend your use of the Service at any time for any reason, including breach of these Terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">9. Disclaimer and Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <ul class="list-[lower-alpha] pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Our Service is provided "as is" without any express or implied warranties.</li>
            <li>To the maximum extent permitted by law, AI Resume Advisor LLC shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">10. Dispute Resolution and Governing Law</h2>
          <ul class="list-[lower-alpha] pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Wyoming, without regard to its conflict of law provisions.</li>
            <li>Any disputes should first be resolved through friendly negotiation.</li>
            <li>If resolution cannot be reached through negotiation, the dispute will be submitted to the appropriate courts in Wyoming for adjudication. Both parties consent to the exclusive jurisdiction of Wyoming courts for any such disputes.</li>
            <li>You agree that the courts of Wyoming are the appropriate venue for any legal actions or proceedings related to these Terms or our Service.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">11. Modifications to Terms</h2>
          <p>
            We may modify these Terms from time to time. Modified terms will be posted on the website and will be effective immediately upon posting. Continued use of our Service after any such changes shall constitute your consent to such changes.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">12. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us at: <a href="mailto:wenhao@airesumeadvisor.com" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-hover">wenhao@airesumeadvisor.com</a>
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="mt-12 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-6">
          <p class="text-sm text-text-caption">
            By using our Service, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .prose h2 {
    @apply mt-8 mb-4;
  }
  .prose p {
    @apply mb-4;
  }
  .prose ul {
    @apply mb-4;
  }
</style>
